{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/10660","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/10660/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/10660/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/10660/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/10660","id":170549366,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxNzA1NDkzNjY=","number":10660,"title":"[upgrade-adapter-rc.4] change detection does not work sometime on a hybrid app","user":{"login":"huyph","id":3280795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODA3OTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3280795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph","html_url":"https://github.com/huyph","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyph/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2016-08-11T00:33:20Z","updated_at":"2019-09-10T11:22:52Z","closed_at":"2016-12-17T08:51:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**I'm submitting a ...**  (check one with \"x\")\n\n```\n[ X ] bug report\n```\n\nOn a hybrid application (mixture of ng1 and ng2), change detection doesn't work sometime\n\n**Current behavior**\nIn `upgrade_adapter.ts`:\n\n``` javascript\nngZone.onMicrotaskEmpty.subscribe({\n                        next: (_: any) => ngZone.runOutsideAngular(() => rootScope.$evalAsync())\n                      });\n```\n\n**Expected/desired behavior**\nIf I change this to: \n\n``` javascript\nngZone.onMicrotaskEmpty.subscribe({\n                        next: (_: any) => ngZone.run(() => rootScope.$evalAsync())\n                      });\n```\n\nChange detection seems to work.\n\nOne drawback is: this will re-introduce the infinite `$rootScope.$digest` (https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/6385)\n\n**Reproduction of the problem**\nUnfortunately I haven't been able to replicate the issue on plunker, it only happens on a specific situation I have on one of my production servers.\n\nBut hopefully someone who is familiar with the codes above, can give me a light on what can affect this code, and I will give another go at replicating the issue on plunker.\n\nThanks guys! \n\n**What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?**\nTo make hybrid application possible\n- **Angular version:** 2.0.0-rc.4\n- **Browser:** Chrome 51.0.2704.106\n- **Language:** TypeScript 1.8 | ES6\n","closed_by":{"login":"petebacondarwin","id":15655,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15655?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin","html_url":"https://github.com/petebacondarwin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith